sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Chair as Chair (Mary Tan)
    participant UI as Browser
    participant App as Django app
    participant AI as AI adapters<br/>sample or Azure OpenAI
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.06)
    Note over Chair,DB: 001 Sign-in and hotel access · 002 Weekly meetings · 003 Action items
    Chair->>UI: Sign in as Mary Tan, open today's meeting
    UI->>App: Request the meeting
    App->>DB: Load the meeting (Hotel A only)
    App-->>UI: Meeting screen with Record and Add action
    end

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.12)
    Note over Chair,DB: 004 Record and transcribe
    Chair->>UI: Start recording, the team agrees actions, Stop recording
    UI->>App: Upload the audio
    App->>AI: transcribe(audio)
    AI-->>App: Transcript text
    App->>DB: Save the transcript with the meeting
    App-->>UI: Show the transcript
    end

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.06)
    Note over Chair,DB: 005 Extract proposed items
    App->>AI: extract(transcript, fixed lists, hotel people, meeting date)
    AI-->>App: Action items as JSON
    App->>App: Keep only valid list values and hotel people
    App->>DB: Save the items as Proposed
    App-->>UI: Review page: "Proposed by AI"
    end

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.12)
    Note over Chair,DB: 006 Review and confirm (AI proposes, a person confirms)
    Chair->>UI: Edit or remove items, then Confirm selected
    UI->>App: Confirm the selected items
    App->>DB: Create Open actions "From recording", mark items Confirmed
    App-->>UI: The meeting shows the confirmed actions
    end
